    "description": "Natural Stone Collection\nAssorted Decorative River Rocks and Pebbles\nNatural Stone Mix\nLot Dimensions: 7\" x 10\" x 2.25\"\nTotal Weight: 7.0 lbs\nThis diverse collection features a curated selection of natural river rocks and decorative pebbles, showcasing organic textures and tones. The assortment includes smooth-contoured stones in a neutral palette of charcoal grey, ivory, and warm tan. These stones are ideal for sophisticated interior decor, terrarium layering, aquarium substrate, or garden landscaping.\nWide variety of shapes and sizes ranging from small pebbles to larger smooth stones\nNatural color palette provides a clean aesthetic suitable for modern or rustic themes\nMulti-purpose use for crafts, drainage, floral arrangements, or outdoor path accents\nCondition:\nGood natural condition. As these are natural stone products, they exhibit inherent variations in color and texture. Surface characteristics include natural pitting and organic matte to satin finishes.\nOverall Condition\n: All items are USED and are sold AS-IS. Please open a ticket for any questions prior to bidding.\nUsed Item Description\n: Used condition indicates item(s) show signs of regular use, age and may have had repairs or may need repairs. All items featured are DONATED and all sales are FINAL. All BIDS are placed by the buyer with the understanding that this is a donated item that may contain faults unseen by our staff and is ultimately SOLD AS-IS as all information is presented. Items come strictly as pictured and should be assumed to be AS-IS with possible unseen defects. We are\nNOT\nexperts in any field.",
